flowchart LR
    A[User request] --> B[API gateway + auth]
    B --> C[Input validation + safety filter]
    C --> D[Cache check]
    D -- hit --> E[Return cached response]
    D -- miss --> F[Router: pick model by cost/quality]
    F --> G[Model call with timeout]
    G --> H{Success?}
    H -- No --> I[Retry / fallback model]
    I --> G
    H -- Yes --> J[Output validation + guardrails]
    J --> K[Response + log]
    K --> L[Monitor: latency, cost, quality, drift]
